  "fullScreenDialogDescription": "Use this type of dialog when you need to present a large amount of information,\nform inputs, or other UI elements that wouldn't fit in a typical alert box.\nIt takes over the whole screen and often has an AppBar.",
  "loremIpsumDummyText": "Lorem Ipsum is simply dummy text of the printing and typesetting industry. Lorem Ipsum has been the industry's standard dummy text ever since the 1500s, when an unknown printer took a galley of type and scrambled it to make a type specimen book. It has survived not only five centuries, but also the leap into electronic typesetting, remaining essentially unchanged. It was popularised in the 1960s with the release of Letraset sheets containing Lorem Ipsum passages, and more recently with desktop publishing software like Aldus PageMaker including versions of Lorem Ipsum.",
  "loremIpsumDummyText2": "It is a long established fact that a reader will be distracted by the readable content of a page when looking at its layout. The point of using Lorem Ipsum is that it has a more-or-less normal distribution of letters, as opposed to using 'Content here, content here', making it look like readable English. Many desktop publishing packages and web page editors now use Lorem Ipsum as their default model text, and a search for 'lorem ipsum' will uncover many web sites still in their infancy. Various versions have evolved over the years, sometimes by accident, sometimes on purpose (injected humour and the like).",
  "loremIpsumDummyText3": "Contrary to popular belief, Lorem Ipsum is not simply random text. It has roots in a piece of classical Latin literature from 45 BC, making it over 2000 years old. Richard McClintock, a Latin professor at Hampden-Sydney College in Virginia, looked up one of the more obscure Latin words, consectetur, from a Lorem Ipsum passage, and going through the cites of the word in classical literature, discovered the undoubtable source. Lorem Ipsum comes from sections 1.10.32 and 1.10.33 of \"de Finibus Bonorum et Malorum\" (The Extremes of Good and Evil) by Cicero, written in 45 BC. This book is a treatise on the theory of ethics, very popular during the Renaissance. The first line of Lorem Ipsum, \"Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet..\", comes from a line in section 1.10.32.\n\nThe standard chunk of Lorem Ipsum used since the 1500s is reproduced below for those interested. Sections 1.10.32 and 1.10.33 from \"de Finibus Bonorum et Malorum\" by Cicero are also reproduced in their exact original form, accompanied by English versions from the 1914 translation by H. Rackham.",
  "faq1": "What is an Admin Dashboard UI Kit?",
  "faq1Ans": "A collection of pre-built UI components and layouts designed to speed up the development of admin panels or management systems.",
  "faq2": "Is the UI kit responsive across all devices?",
  "faq2Ans": "Yes, the UI kit is fully responsive and adapts seamlessly to desktops, tablets, and mobile screens.",
  "faq3": "Can I customize the colors and themes?",
  "faq3Ans": "Absolutely. The kit supports full theming capabilities, allowing you to change primary colors, fonts, and layout styles.",
  "faq4": "Which frontend frameworks are supported?",
  "faq4Ans": "The UI kit is built with Flutter and can be integrated into most modern app architectures.",
  "faq5": "Does the kit support dark mode?",
  "faq5Ans": "Yes, both light and dark themes are included, and switching between them is handled dynamically.",
  "faq6": "Can I use this kit for commercial projects?",
  "faq6Ans": "Yes, depending on the license purchased, you can use the UI kit in personal and commercial projects.",
  "faq7": "Are regular updates provided?",
  "faq7Ans": "Yes, we offer regular updates with bug fixes, performance improvements, and new components.",
  "faq8": "How can I request a new feature or component?",
  "faq8Ans": "You can submit feature requests via our support form or email.",
  "faq9": "Does this include authentication pages?",
  "faq9Ans": "Yes, the kit includes login, signup, forgot password, and reset password screens.",
  "faq10": "Are there built-in form validations?",
  "faq10Ans": "Yes, commonly used forms include client-side validation and support for custom validation logic.",
  "faq11": "Is multi-language support available?",
  "faq11Ans": "Yes, the UI kit includes localize your app into multiple languages.",
  "faq12": "What browsers are supported?",
  "faq12Ans": "The UI kit is tested with all modern browsers including Chrome, Firefox, Safari, and Edge.",
  "faq13": "Is there documentation or a style guide available?",
  "faq13Ans": "Yes, full documentation and a design system guide are included to help you understand the structure and usage.",
  "privacyPolicy": "Privacy Policy",
  "privacyPolicyTitle1": "Introduction",
  "privacyPolicySubTitle1": "This Privacy Policy outlines how we collect, use, disclose, and protect your personal information when you access or use our services. By using our platform, you agree to the practices described in this policy. We are committed to maintaining transparency and protecting your privacy at all times.",
  "privacyPolicyTitle2": "Information We Collect",
  "privacyPolicySubTitle2": "We may collect various types of information, including personal data (such as name, email address, phone number), usage data (device info, browser type, pages visited), and any content you voluntarily provide. This helps us personalize your experience and improve our services.",
  "privacyPolicyTitle3": "How We Use Your Information",
  "privacyPolicySubTitle3": "Your information is used to operate and improve our services, provide customer support, personalize content, send important updates, analyze usage trends, and enhance security. We may also use it for marketing with your consent.",
  "privacyPolicyTitle4": "Data Sharing and Disclosure",
  "privacyPolicySubTitle4": "We do not sell your personal information. However, we may share it with trusted third parties such as service providers, business partners, or legal authorities when required. All such parties are contractually obligated to keep your data confidential and secure.",
  "privacyPolicyTitle5": "Cookies and Tracking Technologies",
  "privacyPolicySubTitle5": "Our platform uses cookies and similar technologies to collect information about your browsing behavior. This allows us to remember preferences, analyze traffic, and deliver relevant content. You can control cookie settings through your browser.",
  "privacyPolicyTitle6": "Third-Party Services",
  "privacyPolicySubTitle6": "We may use third-party tools and platforms (e.g., Google Analytics, Firebase) to help us analyze usage or deliver specific services. These third parties may collect data under their own privacy policies. We ensure they comply with industry standards for data protection.",
  "privacyPolicyTitle7": "Data Storage and Security",
  "privacyPolicySubTitle7": "We implement physical, technical, and organizational measures to safeguard your data against unauthorized access, alteration, disclosure, or destruction. Data is stored on secure servers with regular audits and encrypted protocols in place.",
  "privacyPolicyTitle8": "User Rights",
  "privacyPolicySubTitle8": "Depending on your jurisdiction, you may have rights to access, update, delete, or restrict the use of your personal information. You may also object to certain processing activities. To exercise these rights, please contact our support team.",
  "privacyPolicyTitle9": "Children’s Privacy",
  "privacyPolicySubTitle9": "Our services are not intended for children under the age of 13 (or the age defined by local law). We do not knowingly collect personal data from minors. If we discover such data, we will take immediate steps to delete it.",
  "privacyPolicyTitle10": "Effective Date",
  "privacyPolicySubTitle10": "This policy is effective as of [insert date]. Continued use of our services after any updates implies your acceptance of the revised policy.",
  "TermsConditions": "Terms & Conditions",
  "TermsConditionsTitle1": "Introduction",
  "TermsConditionsSubTitle1": "These Terms and Conditions govern your use of our platform and services. By accessing or using our services, you agree to comply with these terms. Please read them carefully before proceeding.",
  "TermsConditionsTitle2": "Eligibility",
  "TermsConditionsSubTitle2": "You must be at least 18 years old or meet the legal age requirement in your jurisdiction to use our services. By using our platform, you confirm that you meet the eligibility criteria.",
  "TermsConditionsTitle3": "Account Registration",
  "TermsConditionsSubTitle3": "To access certain features, you may need to create an account. You agree to provide accurate and complete information and are responsible for maintaining the confidentiality of your login credentials.",
  "TermsConditionsTitle4": "User Responsibilities",
  "TermsConditionsSubTitle4": "You agree to use the platform only for lawful purposes. You must not engage in any activity that could harm the platform, its users, or its infrastructure, including hacking, spamming, or spreading malware",
  "TermsConditionsTitle5": "Intellectual Property",
  "TermsConditionsSubTitle5": "All content, designs, graphics, logos, and software are the property of the company or its licensors. You may not copy, modify, distribute, or create derivative works without our express written permission.",
  "TermsConditionsTitle6": "User-Generated Content",
  "TermsConditionsSubTitle6": "You retain ownership of any content you submit, but you grant us a non-exclusive, royalty-free license to use, display, and distribute it for service-related purposes. You are solely responsible for your content.",
  "TermsConditionsTitle7": "Prohibited Activities",
  "TermsConditionsSubTitle7": "You may not use the service for illegal purposes, harassment, hate speech, distributing harmful or offensive content, or infringing intellectual property rights of others. Violation may lead to suspension or termination.",
  "TermsConditionsTitle8": "Subscription and Payments",
  "TermsConditionsSubTitle8": "If you choose a paid plan, you agree to pay all applicable fees. Subscriptions may auto-renew unless canceled before the end of the current billing cycle. All payments are non-refundable unless otherwise stated.",
  "TermsConditionsTitle9": "Feedback and Suggestions",
  "TermsConditionsSubTitle9": "Any feedback, ideas, or suggestions submitted by users are considered non-confidential and may be used by us without any obligation to compensate or acknowledge you.",
  "TermsConditionsTitle10": "Contact Information",
  "TermsConditionsSubTitle10": "For any questions, concerns, or clarifications regarding these Terms, you can reach us at support@CBITUNISIA.com.",
